<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<bpmn:definitions xmlns:bpmn="http://www.omg.org/spec/BPMN/20100524/MODEL" xmlns:bpmndi="http://www.omg.org/spec/BPMN/20100524/DI" xmlns:dc="http://www.omg.org/spec/DD/20100524/DC" xmlns:di="http://www.omg.org/spec/DD/20100524/DI" id="Defs_L3_3_3_1" targetNamespace="https://teck.example/process-models/pillar-03">
  <bpmn:collaboration id="Collab_L3_3_3_1">
    <bpmn:participant id="Pool_L3_3_3_1" name="3.3.1 Concentrate Thickening" processRef="Process_L3_3_3_1"/>
  </bpmn:collaboration>
  <bpmn:process id="Process_L3_3_3_1" isExecutable="false">
    <bpmn:documentation>L0/L1/L2 Process. Concentrate thickener(s) settle and compact the dilute flotation concentrate slurry by gravity sedimentation, aided by flocculant addition. Thickener underflow (high-density slurry, typically 55–70% solids) is pumped to the filter. Thickener overflow (clarified process water) is returned to the process water circuit. Separate thickeners are operated per concentrate type at polymetallic operations.</bpmn:documentation>
    <bpmn:laneSet id="LaneSet_L3_3_3_1">
      <bpmn:lane id="Lane_L3_3_3_1_dcs" name="DCS Auto-control">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>Start_L3_3_3_1_s</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>Service_L3_3_3_1_3_3_1_1</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>Service_L3_3_3_1_3_3_1_2</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>Service_L3_3_3_1_3_3_1_3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>End_L3_3_3_1_e</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
      </bpmn:lane>
      <bpmn:lane id="Lane_L3_3_3_1_cro" name="Control Room Operator">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>Gw_L3_3_3_1_g</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>Task_L3_3_3_1_n1</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
      </bpmn:lane>
    </bpmn:laneSet>
    <bpmn:startEvent id="Start_L3_3_3_1_s" name="Cleaner concentrate flowing to thickener">
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_L3_3_3_1_1</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:startEvent>
    <bpmn:serviceTask id="Service_L3_3_3_1_3_3_1_1" name="3.3.1.1 Feed Concentrate to Thickener">
      <bpmn:documentation>Flotation concentrate slurry (Cu, Zn, or Pb cleaner overflow) is pumped from the cleaner circuit to the thickener feedwell. Feed rate (m³/hr and t solids/hr) is measured by magnetic flowmeter and nuclear density gauge on the concentrate feed line. This measurement is the first fixed-instrument mass flow measurement of the final concentrate product stream. [P754: mass flow + density (solids t/hr) | magnetic flowmeter + nuclear density gauge | continuous (1-min) | Principles 1, 2, 7 | PARTIAL — this is the first fixed mass flow measurement of the concentrate product stream]
ISA-95 level: 1 / 2
Actors: DCS Auto-control
Standard alignment: ISA-95 Levels 1, 2; AMIRA P754 Principles 1, 2, 7
DDVC layer: Raw (time-series)</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_L3_3_3_1_1</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_L3_3_3_1_2</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:serviceTask>
    <bpmn:serviceTask id="Service_L3_3_3_1_3_3_1_2" name="3.3.1.2 Dose Flocculant">
      <bpmn:documentation>Polymer flocculant is dosed into the thickener feedwell to accelerate particle settling and achieve target underflow density. Dosage rate (g/t of solids) is set by the metallurgist and controlled by DCS. Excessive dosing increases cost without benefit; under-dosing produces dilute underflow and reduces filter throughput. Flocculant consumption is tracked per shift (kg or g/t solids). [P754: mass (flocculant consumption) | dosing pump counter + tank level | shift total | Principle 1 | NO]
ISA-95 level: 1 / 2
Actors: DCS Auto-control; Metallurgist
Standard alignment: ISA-95 Levels 1, 2; AMIRA P754 Principle 1
DDVC layer: Raw</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_L3_3_3_1_2</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_L3_3_3_1_6</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_L3_3_3_1_3</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:serviceTask>
    <bpmn:exclusiveGateway id="Gw_L3_3_3_1_g" name="Underflow density below minimum?" default="Flow_L3_3_3_1_5">
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_L3_3_3_1_3</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_L3_3_3_1_4</bpmn:outgoing>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_L3_3_3_1_5</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:exclusiveGateway>
    <bpmn:task id="Task_L3_3_3_1_n1" name="Reduce feed rate or increase flocculant">
      <bpmn:documentation>Derived from the Process Flow Narratives section (not a row in the Process Decomposition).</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_L3_3_3_1_4</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_L3_3_3_1_6</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:serviceTask id="Service_L3_3_3_1_3_3_1_3" name="3.3.1.3 Pump Thickener Underflow to Filter">
      <bpmn:documentation>Thickener underflow pump transfers high-density concentrate slurry from the thickener cone to the filter feed tank. Underflow density (nuclear density gauge) and flow rate (magnetic flowmeter) are monitored continuously. Underflow density is the primary thickener control variable — target density ensures efficient filter performance. [P754: mass flow + density (solids t/hr) | magnetic flowmeter + nuclear density gauge | continuous (1-min) | Principles 1, 7 | NO — internal transfer]
ISA-95 level: 1 / 2
Actors: DCS Auto-control
Standard alignment: ISA-95 Levels 1, 2; AMIRA P754 Principles 1, 7
DDVC layer: Raw (time-series: thickener_telemetry)</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_L3_3_3_1_5</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_L3_3_3_1_7</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:serviceTask>
    <bpmn:endEvent id="End_L3_3_3_1_e" name="Underflow at target density to filter feed tank">
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_L3_3_3_1_7</bpmn:incoming>
    </bpmn:endEvent>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_L3_3_3_1_1" sourceRef="Start_L3_3_3_1_s" targetRef="Service_L3_3_3_1_3_3_1_1"/>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_L3_3_3_1_2" sourceRef="Service_L3_3_3_1_3_3_1_1" targetRef="Service_L3_3_3_1_3_3_1_2"/>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_L3_3_3_1_3" sourceRef="Service_L3_3_3_1_3_3_1_2" targetRef="Gw_L3_3_3_1_g"/>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_L3_3_3_1_4" name="Yes" sourceRef="Gw_L3_3_3_1_g" targetRef="Task_L3_3_3_1_n1"/>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_L3_3_3_1_5" name="No" sourceRef="Gw_L3_3_3_1_g" targetRef="Service_L3_3_3_1_3_3_1_3"/>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_L3_3_3_1_6" name="Re-check density" sourceRef="Task_L3_3_3_1_n1" targetRef="Service_L3_3_3_1_3_3_1_2"/>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_L3_3_3_1_7" sourceRef="Service_L3_3_3_1_3_3_1_3" targetRef="End_L3_3_3_1_e"/>
  </bpmn:process>
  <bpmndi:BPMNDiagram id="Diagram_L3_3_3_1">
    <bpmndi:BPMNPlane id="Plane_L3_3_3_1" bpmnElement="Collab_L3_3_3_1">
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Pool_L3_3_3_1_di" bpmnElement="Pool_L3_3_3_1" isHorizontal="true"><dc:Bounds x="20" y="20" width="1022" height="340"/></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Lane_L3_3_3_1_dcs_di" bpmnElement="Lane_L3_3_3_1_dcs" isHorizontal="true"><dc:Bounds x="60" y="20" width="982" height="170"/></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Lane_L3_3_3_1_cro_di" bpmnElement="Lane_L3_3_3_1_cro" isHorizontal="true"><dc:Bounds x="60" y="190" width="982" height="170"/></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Start_L3_3_3_1_s_di" bpmnElement="Start_L3_3_3_1_s"><dc:Bounds x="110" y="77" width="56" height="56"/><bpmndi:BPMNLabel><dc:Bounds x="88" y="139" width="100" height="56"/></bpmndi:BPMNLabel></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Service_L3_3_3_1_3_3_1_1_di" bpmnElement="Service_L3_3_3_1_3_3_1_1"><dc:Bounds x="202" y="65" width="170" height="80"/></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Service_L3_3_3_1_3_3_1_2_di" bpmnElement="Service_L3_3_3_1_3_3_1_2"><dc:Bounds x="408" y="65" width="170" height="80"/></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Gw_L3_3_3_1_g_di" bpmnElement="Gw_L3_3_3_1_g" isMarkerVisible="true"><dc:Bounds x="614" y="240" width="70" height="70"/><bpmndi:BPMNLabel><dc:Bounds x="599" y="316" width="100" height="56"/></bpmndi:BPMNLabel></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Task_L3_3_3_1_n1_di" bpmnElement="Task_L3_3_3_1_n1"><dc:Bounds x="720" y="235" width="170" height="80"/></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Service_L3_3_3_1_3_3_1_3_di" bpmnElement="Service_L3_3_3_1_3_3_1_3"><dc:Bounds x="720" y="65" width="170" height="80"/></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="End_L3_3_3_1_e_di" bpmnElement="End_L3_3_3_1_e"><dc:Bounds x="926" y="77" width="56" height="56"/><bpmndi:BPMNLabel><dc:Bounds x="904" y="139" width="100" height="70"/></bpmndi:BPMNLabel></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="Flow_L3_3_3_1_1_di" bpmnElement="Flow_L3_3_3_1_1"><di:waypoint x="166" y="105"/><di:waypoint x="202" y="105"/></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
      <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="Flow_L3_3_3_1_2_di" bpmnElement="Flow_L3_3_3_1_2"><di:waypoint x="372" y="105"/><di:waypoint x="408" y="105"/></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
      <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="Flow_L3_3_3_1_3_di" bpmnElement="Flow_L3_3_3_1_3"><di:waypoint x="578" y="105"/><di:waypoint x="596" y="105"/><di:waypoint x="596" y="275"/><di:waypoint x="614" y="275"/></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
      <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="Flow_L3_3_3_1_4_di" bpmnElement="Flow_L3_3_3_1_4"><di:waypoint x="684" y="275"/><di:waypoint x="720" y="275"/><bpmndi:BPMNLabel><dc:Bounds x="688" y="255" width="27" height="14"/></bpmndi:BPMNLabel></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
      <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="Flow_L3_3_3_1_5_di" bpmnElement="Flow_L3_3_3_1_5"><di:waypoint x="649" y="240"/><di:waypoint x="649" y="105"/><di:waypoint x="720" y="105"/><bpmndi:BPMNLabel><dc:Bounds x="655" y="222" width="21" height="14"/></bpmndi:BPMNLabel></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
      <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="Flow_L3_3_3_1_6_di" bpmnElement="Flow_L3_3_3_1_6"><di:waypoint x="805" y="315"/><di:waypoint x="805" y="376"/><di:waypoint x="493" y="376"/><di:waypoint x="493" y="145"/><bpmndi:BPMNLabel><dc:Bounds x="501" y="380" width="112" height="14"/></bpmndi:BPMNLabel></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
      <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="Flow_L3_3_3_1_7_di" bpmnElement="Flow_L3_3_3_1_7"><di:waypoint x="890" y="105"/><di:waypoint x="926" y="105"/></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
    </bpmndi:BPMNPlane>
  </bpmndi:BPMNDiagram>
</bpmn:definitions>
